WEBVTT

00:09.030 --> 00:13.520
Regulus' invincibility
is related to his wives.

00:13.520 --> 00:15.830
To unmask the Emperor's New Clothes,

00:15.830 --> 00:19.120
we're gonna have to drag his wives
out of his little kingdom.

00:19.120 --> 00:21.310
It's up to you to find a way.

00:24.170 --> 00:25.340
Thank goodness.

00:26.580 --> 00:27.910
You're all still here.

00:29.470 --> 00:30.890
Please, everyone!

00:30.890 --> 00:32.720
Listen to me!

00:33.270 --> 00:34.760
We can beat Regulus!

00:35.160 --> 00:38.430
But I need your help!

00:41.370 --> 00:45.910
I know the battle's outcome
doesn't decide who's right or wrong.

00:46.440 --> 00:48.780
But if we lose here, I'm sure...

00:48.780 --> 00:51.030
I'm sure he'll trample
upon something precious!

00:55.470 --> 00:57.950
Something precious, you say?

00:58.830 --> 01:01.670
Are you referring to your life?

01:01.670 --> 01:04.170
Life is precious, really precious.

01:04.670 --> 01:06.840
But that's not everything, right?

01:06.840 --> 01:10.550
No, at the very least, for us,
that's all there is.

01:11.060 --> 01:14.140
We don't want to hope for anything more.

01:14.140 --> 01:16.390
No, you're more than...

01:21.480 --> 01:24.110
Can you tell me your name?

01:24.810 --> 01:27.010
Not your number, but your name.

01:30.070 --> 01:31.280
Why...?

01:31.660 --> 01:34.820
I didn't know anything about you.

01:34.820 --> 01:37.330
And yet, I thought I could ask you
for a favor.

01:37.330 --> 01:39.040
That was selfish of me, wasn't it?

01:39.040 --> 01:41.370
I have nothing more to say.

01:41.370 --> 01:44.290
You are no longer one
of Lord Husband's brides.

01:45.340 --> 01:47.420
You're different from us now.

01:47.420 --> 01:49.760
You know, I'm a half-elf.

01:51.090 --> 01:53.720
It's true.
All of you and I are different.

01:53.720 --> 01:55.350
Our circumstances, our backgrounds,

01:55.890 --> 01:58.810
even the very core of who we are.

01:59.290 --> 02:00.640
But that's fine and dandy.

02:00.640 --> 02:04.270
Even if we're different, we can still
understand each other and talk things out!

02:04.770 --> 02:06.980
Daisukiyaki is delicious, after all!

02:08.150 --> 02:09.820
What are you trying to say?

02:10.280 --> 02:14.200
You and I are different,
but that's okay!

02:15.930 --> 02:19.010
So please, tell me your name.

02:19.620 --> 02:23.150
I'm Emilia, just Emilia.

02:23.150 --> 02:25.330
I'm a half-elf,
different from you in many ways.

02:25.880 --> 02:28.360
But I'm sure we have plenty in common too.

02:29.000 --> 02:30.300
I want to help you.

02:31.880 --> 02:33.010
Don't toy with me!

02:33.510 --> 02:37.220
Why must you try and make us human
after everything that's happened?!

02:37.640 --> 02:40.890
That man was content as long as
we were his obedient dolls.

02:40.890 --> 02:42.850
That's how we survived!

02:42.850 --> 02:47.350
Because we believed that it was
our one meager act of resistance!

02:47.940 --> 02:49.020
But then you...

02:49.480 --> 02:52.940
What do you know about us?!

02:53.820 --> 02:56.410
I know you girls are kind.

02:56.410 --> 02:58.660
What do you know about us?!

02:59.120 --> 03:02.540
I know you girls are really earnest.

03:02.540 --> 03:03.910
What do you—

03:03.910 --> 03:07.130
I know you girls are crying for help.

03:08.580 --> 03:12.250
Your entire being is crying out for help.

03:13.160 --> 03:15.720
Your eyes, your voice,
everything about you.

03:16.510 --> 03:17.970
That's why I'll help you.

03:18.360 --> 03:22.100
But to do that,
I want you girls to help me too.

03:23.240 --> 03:25.410
You want us... to help...?

03:26.730 --> 03:27.520
Please.

03:28.010 --> 03:33.530
Let me help you, my knight,
and everyone else.

03:40.140 --> 03:41.540
Please wait a moment.

03:42.990 --> 03:44.910
I have something to ask,

03:44.910 --> 03:47.670
a question I was never able
to ask you all before.

03:49.210 --> 03:52.300
Does anyone here like that man?

03:59.720 --> 04:00.980
...I hate him.

04:01.930 --> 04:03.570
I hate him.

04:04.120 --> 04:05.390
I hate him, too.

04:05.390 --> 04:06.520
I hated him all this time.

04:06.520 --> 04:07.770
I've never liked him.

04:07.770 --> 04:09.400
- I hate him, I truly do.
- He's messed up.

04:09.400 --> 04:10.270
He's insane.

04:10.270 --> 04:11.650
- Who could ever love someone like him?
- He only cares about himself.

04:11.650 --> 04:12.320
I've rejected him over and over
in my head.

04:12.320 --> 04:13.270
He should just drop dead.

04:13.270 --> 04:14.400
But it didn't matter.

04:14.400 --> 04:16.650
- I hate him more than yesterday.
- I really hate him!

04:16.650 --> 04:18.450
And I'll hate him even more tomorrow.

04:18.450 --> 04:19.910
- I hate the way he talks.
- He's just a child in an adult's body.

04:19.910 --> 04:21.530
I'd rather be with an earth dragon!

04:21.530 --> 04:24.200
- He's not even worth comparing to anything.
- He just doesn't stop talking.

04:24.200 --> 04:24.910
I've always wanted to throw up.

04:24.910 --> 04:25.700
When he touches me,
I feel like I'm going to rot away.

04:25.700 --> 04:27.410
I want him to die every time he talks.

04:27.410 --> 04:29.920
How could I ever love someone
who dragged me here against my will?

04:29.920 --> 04:31.670
I wish his insides would rot.

04:31.670 --> 04:33.210
- I just want to go home!
- I don't need help, just kill that bastard.

04:33.210 --> 04:34.630
- No woman would ever love someone like him.
- I don't need help, just kill that bastard.

04:34.630 --> 04:36.050
- No woman would ever love someone like him.
- Not any men, either.

04:36.050 --> 04:38.590
There's no human being out there
who could ever love him.

04:38.590 --> 04:39.820
...Sylphy.

04:45.700 --> 04:48.020
My name is Sylphy.

04:50.140 --> 04:51.980
That's a really nice name.

04:52.360 --> 04:56.190
We were all in agreement,
yet no one could say a thing.

04:56.660 --> 04:58.690
We absolutely despise that man.

04:59.180 --> 05:01.410
Please let us help.

05:05.160 --> 05:06.330
Thank you.

05:09.080 --> 05:14.790
Still, are we really the source
that powers that man's "kingdom"?

05:14.790 --> 05:17.830
Yes. Do you have any ideas?

05:18.980 --> 05:20.720
Sadly, no...

05:21.110 --> 05:24.680
Would that man even entrust
something so important to us?

05:24.680 --> 05:25.970
I can't imagine it.

05:26.760 --> 05:29.020
Any chance you could be mistaken?

05:29.020 --> 05:31.440
No, I'm sure I'm not.

05:31.910 --> 05:35.020
I don't doubt Subaru
when it comes to important things.

05:36.190 --> 05:39.320
If you notice anything,
please let me know.

05:45.160 --> 05:46.330
Wait...

05:46.330 --> 05:47.490
Don't tell me...

05:48.030 --> 05:49.200
Is something the matter?

05:49.560 --> 05:51.750
There's something I want to check.

05:51.750 --> 05:53.960
Could you help me out, Sylphy?!

05:53.960 --> 05:55.210
O-Of course!

05:55.210 --> 05:56.880
Okay, then please excuse me.

06:07.720 --> 06:08.890
How awful!

06:09.380 --> 06:15.690
Regulus attaches his heart
to people he decides are his wives!

06:21.440 --> 06:23.010
C-Crap...

06:24.110 --> 06:26.700
For someone who ran around
doing whatever he pleased,

06:26.700 --> 06:28.740
you fell far too easily.

06:29.190 --> 06:33.210
Now, tell me where that adulteress is.

06:33.660 --> 06:36.710
Do so, and I'll grant you an easy death.

06:36.710 --> 06:38.840
I am a merciful man, after all.

06:39.470 --> 06:42.970
Merciful people...

06:43.430 --> 06:47.550
don't use their powers...
on their brides...

06:48.390 --> 06:51.140
So you've realized that much, at least.

06:51.140 --> 06:53.100
You're a cunning man,

06:53.640 --> 06:55.940
yet your efforts all ended in vain.

06:56.810 --> 07:00.190
Because your wives won't betray you...?

07:00.190 --> 07:01.650
It is far simpler.

07:02.190 --> 07:06.070
I have entrusted
my precious heart to my wives.

07:06.070 --> 07:12.370
But neither I nor my wives themselves
are aware of who actually bears it.

07:13.500 --> 07:16.120
Are you saying... to beat you,

07:16.120 --> 07:21.000
we'd have to stop the hearts
of all your wives?

07:22.800 --> 07:24.300
How much must that man...

07:25.590 --> 07:28.760
trample on people's hearts
until he's satisfied?!

07:29.430 --> 07:30.720
Sylphy...

07:30.720 --> 07:35.310
I should've done this from the start...

07:36.020 --> 07:36.980
Wait!

07:37.370 --> 07:38.810
What are you doing?!

07:39.270 --> 07:44.150
The only way to stop that man's heart
is to stop our hearts along with it.

07:44.150 --> 07:46.320
No! Please wait!

07:46.320 --> 07:49.240
There... there has to be another way!

07:49.680 --> 07:52.700
That man would never leave
any room for escape.

07:53.740 --> 07:55.750
How can you give up like that?!

07:55.750 --> 07:57.640
I'll never accept this!

07:58.330 --> 07:59.670
If I do that...

08:00.250 --> 08:03.210
If I just leave people
to die in front of me...

08:03.880 --> 08:07.130
...then why did I even leave
the forest in the first place?!

08:07.130 --> 08:11.910
Even though he trampled on my heart,
he never laid a hand on my body.

08:11.910 --> 08:13.390
That's why I lasted this long.

08:13.830 --> 08:14.850
And yet...!

08:15.240 --> 08:18.480
That man deems us
worthless and kills us

08:18.480 --> 08:20.920
if our bodies bear
even the smallest scratch!

08:21.560 --> 08:26.320
That's why...
this wound is proof of my freedom.

08:27.070 --> 08:33.030
There's no other way for me to get revenge
for everything that man has done.

08:33.450 --> 08:35.410
If I were to die,

08:35.410 --> 08:38.410
I'm sure that man's heart would
simply move on to someone else.

08:38.910 --> 08:42.500
After all, that man
could only ever love himself.

08:43.000 --> 08:44.670
Yes, that's right.

08:45.380 --> 08:48.220
I've thought about dying
countless times before.

08:48.220 --> 08:52.070
Yeah, I should just die
and meet my family again.

08:52.640 --> 08:53.850
Please.

08:54.600 --> 08:56.520
Let it end with us.

08:56.930 --> 09:02.610
Please, make sure our rage
reaches that man.

09:05.860 --> 09:06.530
Wait!

09:11.280 --> 09:13.320
Please! Stop this!

09:13.320 --> 09:15.240
I'm sorry, I was wrong.

09:15.790 --> 09:19.510
I can stop your hearts.

09:24.080 --> 09:27.710
I'm sorry, I can't think of any other way.

09:29.170 --> 09:31.010
Please don't apologize.

09:31.010 --> 09:32.890
Thank you!

09:35.100 --> 09:37.430
Hah... Alright.

09:37.430 --> 09:39.310
Hah? Wait, you're...?

09:39.890 --> 09:43.770
Yup. I was playing dead,
or rather, playing almost dead.

09:44.310 --> 09:45.610
I believed in you.

09:46.030 --> 09:47.900
I knew you were the kind of idiot

09:47.900 --> 09:50.740
who just has to brag and yap
in front of a dying enemy.

09:51.180 --> 09:53.570
You just helped me figure you out.

09:53.990 --> 09:56.910
You dare make a fool out of me...?!

09:56.910 --> 10:00.120
Who do you think I am?!

10:02.250 --> 10:05.290
There's no other answer to that
than a "piece of shit"!

10:05.290 --> 10:06.790
How dare you...!

10:08.630 --> 10:12.630
I can act tough all I want, but how am I
supposed to pass this on to Emilia?!

10:18.720 --> 10:19.970
Emilia...

10:19.970 --> 10:21.980
Wait wait wait wait!

10:22.390 --> 10:25.440
No! You couldn't have...!

10:25.880 --> 10:27.060
How could you?!

10:27.060 --> 10:30.530
How could you do something so inhumane!

10:30.530 --> 10:32.900
My wives were innocent!
How could you–

10:38.030 --> 10:39.660
Consider that...

10:40.290 --> 10:45.370
...a divorce letter from your wives!

10:49.630 --> 10:50.750
Emilia!

10:50.750 --> 10:52.550
Subaru! Is that wound going to be okay?

10:52.550 --> 10:54.590
I'm perfectly fine.

10:54.590 --> 10:56.780
More importantly, the wives?

10:57.370 --> 11:00.510
They all said they wanted to beat Regulus,

11:01.020 --> 11:02.360
and...

11:03.590 --> 11:05.560
Emilia, don't tell me...

11:07.520 --> 11:10.980
Then his Lion Heart is now...

11:10.980 --> 11:13.820
No, it looks like
it's not going to be that simple.

11:17.620 --> 11:20.950
Really, I'm amazed at how you can be
so arrogantly insolent,

11:20.950 --> 11:25.410
hopelessly vulgar,
ridiculously incompetent,

11:25.410 --> 11:30.880
unbelievably shameless,
and utterly depraved!

11:31.840 --> 11:36.010
So now what?
After all that running around,

11:36.010 --> 11:39.220
you leave nothing but an endless pile
of sacrifices in your wake!?

11:39.220 --> 11:42.560
Is this supposed to be some kind of joke?!

11:42.560 --> 11:44.770
How exactly are you planning
to make up for this?!

11:44.770 --> 11:49.270
No way! Not with how much you blabbed
about how your Authority worked!

11:49.270 --> 11:55.030
Hah! That unfaithful slattern
probably miscounted!

11:55.560 --> 11:58.740
To think she can't even count
the lives she's stolen.

11:58.740 --> 12:01.660
It is the mindset
of a cold-hearted mass murderer!

12:01.660 --> 12:03.330
Seriously, what is wrong with you?

12:03.330 --> 12:04.370
You bastard!

12:04.370 --> 12:05.620
Fifty-three people.

12:06.040 --> 12:06.960
Hah?

12:07.460 --> 12:08.870
Fifty-three.

12:09.350 --> 12:13.170
That was the number of women
you were imprisoning.

12:13.840 --> 12:17.800
I would never miscount
the number of lives.

12:17.800 --> 12:23.470
Oh? And your point is?

12:24.100 --> 12:27.430
Am I supposed to be amazed
that you can count?

12:27.430 --> 12:30.810
I'm really angry right now.

12:30.810 --> 12:32.940
I don't think I can forgive you anymore.

12:33.570 --> 12:34.590
Subaru,

12:35.930 --> 12:37.740
Regulus' heart is right here.

12:38.200 --> 12:41.000
It's in my chest.

12:43.910 --> 12:46.470
What's so funny, asshole?!

12:47.000 --> 12:49.160
What else?

12:49.160 --> 12:51.380
You understand what this means, right?

12:51.790 --> 12:57.510
The noose is only tightening
around your necks!

12:58.840 --> 13:01.890
Emilia, is his heart really...?

13:01.890 --> 13:03.680
Mm-hmm. It's true.

13:03.680 --> 13:08.390
I had the lesser spirits check,
and I can feel it inside me.

13:08.850 --> 13:12.520
He really did it, despite calling me
unworthy to be his wife.

13:12.890 --> 13:14.440
Quit prattling.

13:14.440 --> 13:18.150
Stop preaching at me like you're
some sort of higher existence, whore.

13:18.150 --> 13:19.650
More importantly,

13:19.650 --> 13:21.400
- Does that mean
- how are you going

13:21.400 --> 13:24.450
- he can stuff his heart into anyone he chooses?
- to take responsibility for murdering my wives?

13:24.450 --> 13:26.790
- If so, then does the Lion Heart
- They were my ideal brides.

13:26.790 --> 13:28.520
- just run away endlessly?
- Do you have any idea how long

13:28.520 --> 13:30.830
it took me to gather them?

13:31.790 --> 13:33.790
Care to try?

13:33.790 --> 13:37.960
See if there's anywhere else
my heart might reside.

13:37.960 --> 13:39.470
Bastard...

13:39.470 --> 13:40.920
It's simple.

13:41.380 --> 13:45.550
Just kill the woman you see
in front of you!

13:47.010 --> 13:49.890
Can you do it?
Of course you can't!

13:52.770 --> 13:53.730
Subaru.

13:54.790 --> 13:57.190
Wait, no!
Don't let him goad you like that!

13:57.190 --> 13:57.820
But!

13:57.820 --> 14:00.320
You absolutely can't!
Anything but that!

14:00.780 --> 14:02.450
You're him, right?

14:02.840 --> 14:07.240
The one behind that noisy broadcast
before the ceremony?

14:07.240 --> 14:08.870
What was that again?

14:08.870 --> 14:11.460
You killed an Archbishop?

14:11.460 --> 14:13.960
Well, that at least was worth a laugh!

14:14.420 --> 14:17.040
It's pitiful how you honestly thought

14:17.040 --> 14:22.260
you could defeat me just because
you killed that waste of skin!

14:22.630 --> 14:29.100
You see, he was always a waste of skin,
before and after he became an Archbishop.

14:29.100 --> 14:30.770
He never achieved a single thing.

14:35.520 --> 14:39.320
No way, is something like that...

14:40.400 --> 14:42.150
even possible?

14:44.840 --> 14:45.820
But...

14:51.500 --> 14:52.750
Emilia.

14:54.540 --> 14:58.170
Can you trust me
and leave everything to me?

14:58.790 --> 14:59.710
Yes.

15:00.250 --> 15:03.970
I've always believed you could do
something about this, Subaru.

15:09.290 --> 15:10.260
Subaru.

15:17.690 --> 15:21.730
Come forth, Unseen Hand!

15:36.620 --> 15:37.620
Oh.

15:38.210 --> 15:39.790
So you were there all along...

15:42.500 --> 15:43.660
...Geuse.

15:51.180 --> 15:53.810
Gotcha!

16:01.690 --> 16:02.690
Subaru!

16:08.860 --> 16:10.910
You're alive... right?

16:12.530 --> 16:13.910
Yeah, I'm fine.

16:13.910 --> 16:18.210
I can feel my heart beating inside me.

16:18.960 --> 16:21.920
Hah? What's this?

16:22.310 --> 16:27.800
Retreating to your own world
while leaving everyone else behind?

16:28.220 --> 16:31.930
Explain yourselves!
What was that farce just now?!

16:32.390 --> 16:34.930
Haven't you noticed yet?

16:36.550 --> 16:38.890
Your feet are wet.

16:41.650 --> 16:42.860
You little–

16:45.820 --> 16:47.690
Yay! We can finally hit him!

16:48.490 --> 16:50.780
Wh-Wha...

16:51.660 --> 16:53.950
You... you...!

16:56.870 --> 16:59.040
Icebrand Arts!

17:04.510 --> 17:06.090
Why?!

17:06.090 --> 17:08.380
Why, why, why?!

17:08.380 --> 17:13.220
What did you scoundrels do
to my Authority as Greed?!

17:13.220 --> 17:15.850
To my rights?!

17:16.250 --> 17:20.140
If you didn't get it after all that,
there's no point in explaining.

17:21.190 --> 17:23.610
But it's simply, really.

17:23.610 --> 17:28.570
You played with your food
and got the tables turned on you.

17:35.990 --> 17:40.330
First, this is from all your wives.
I'll make sure every single one hits you.

17:40.980 --> 17:42.920
Don't toy with me–

17:59.600 --> 18:02.250
Last one! Fifty-three!

18:05.400 --> 18:07.570
And that takes care of their share.

18:08.040 --> 18:09.570
It's time to finish this!

18:10.110 --> 18:11.530
Ul Hyuma!

18:28.840 --> 18:32.300
Now... you've done it...

18:37.800 --> 18:39.510
So that's how it is.

18:39.510 --> 18:40.430
Huh?

18:40.430 --> 18:43.730
He needs to stop his heart
to be invincible now.

18:44.160 --> 18:47.900
He's running on a time limit!

18:51.400 --> 18:53.200
N-Now listenh... here...!

18:53.560 --> 18:57.280
Aren't you two being unfairh?

18:58.280 --> 19:04.290
How could you twoh gang up
on one personh and torment him?!

19:04.670 --> 19:09.420
Don't you have any shame
as human beingsh?!

19:09.820 --> 19:12.590
Wow, you're a real piece of work.

19:12.590 --> 19:14.800
So, what're you trying to say?

19:15.210 --> 19:18.180
Only cowards fight two-on-one,

19:18.180 --> 19:21.140
so I should duel you one-on-one,
fair and square?

19:21.140 --> 19:22.520
Is that it?

19:22.840 --> 19:24.330
Exshactly!

19:24.330 --> 19:25.690
I am...

19:25.690 --> 19:27.730
Who do you think I am?!

19:28.270 --> 19:30.230
I'm none other than...

19:30.230 --> 19:34.360
the Witch Cult's Archbishop of Greed,
Regulus Corneas, you know?!

19:34.740 --> 19:36.860
You always go back on your word,

19:36.860 --> 19:39.990
and every word that comes out
of your mouth is empty and meaningless.

19:40.440 --> 19:44.660
I think you're the most pathetic person
in the world.

19:45.410 --> 19:47.000
How dare you?!

19:47.000 --> 19:51.880
You will regreth makingh a fool out of me!

19:52.630 --> 19:56.970
Alright, Regulus.
I'll give you your duel.

19:57.590 --> 20:00.510
Yes, exactly!

20:00.510 --> 20:05.180
It wouldn't do for a knight
to hide behind his lady's skirt

20:05.180 --> 20:07.480
and simply cheer her on, right?

20:07.480 --> 20:11.440
Right. It's a knight's duty to fight.

20:11.440 --> 20:13.940
Sorry to keep relying on you like this,

20:13.940 --> 20:15.820
but I leave the final blow to you.

20:16.240 --> 20:17.320
Understood!

20:23.790 --> 20:27.290
As a knight,
allow me to accept your challenge.

20:31.290 --> 20:35.630
H-How?! I threw you into the sky...!

20:35.630 --> 20:38.800
Yes, that did cause me some trouble.

20:40.510 --> 20:44.060
However, you made one mistake.

20:44.810 --> 20:48.270
You shouldn't have thrown me
toward the moon.

20:48.690 --> 20:49.730
Hah?

20:50.480 --> 20:53.400
Knight of the Lugunica Royal Guard,

20:53.400 --> 20:56.990
sworn to Lady Felt, and a descendant
of the line of Sword Saints...

20:56.990 --> 20:58.820
Reinhard van Astrea.

20:58.820 --> 21:00.740
W-Wait, wait!

21:02.200 --> 21:04.160
This is absurd!

21:09.290 --> 21:12.210
Impossible, impossible, impossible!

21:12.210 --> 21:15.500
Why do I have to go through this?

21:15.500 --> 21:20.840
I am Regulus Corneas,
the Witch Cult's Archbishop of Greed!

21:20.840 --> 21:25.600
The most fulfilled,
the most complete being in this world!

21:25.600 --> 21:29.140
A being with no room for doubt,
neither in body nor mind!

21:29.620 --> 21:31.770
I am not at fault.
I am not guilty of anything.

21:31.770 --> 21:33.610
You are the ones to blame!

21:33.610 --> 21:38.610
You are the ones who pitied me,
who felt sorry for me and left me alone!

21:39.240 --> 21:40.990
I can hear the laughter.

21:40.990 --> 21:44.530
You're looking at me while laughing,
aren't you?

21:44.530 --> 21:46.120
What's so funny about me?!

21:46.120 --> 21:48.410
What about me made you laugh?!

21:48.810 --> 21:50.660
Stop laughing like that!

21:51.160 --> 21:53.540
My wife didn't laugh!

21:53.540 --> 21:57.840
My first wife never laughed,
no matter what!

21:57.840 --> 22:00.800
She simply looked at me
with her beautiful face, silently.

22:01.200 --> 22:05.930
I killed her family,
I killed everyone who came to her,

22:05.930 --> 22:09.430
and it was just the two of us,
but she never laughed.

22:09.430 --> 22:10.850
And that was fine.

22:10.850 --> 22:13.310
She didn't need to laugh.

22:13.310 --> 22:15.230
It wasn't that I couldn't make her laugh.

22:15.230 --> 22:16.980
She didn't need to laugh!

22:16.980 --> 22:19.070
Her face was beautiful
even without a smile,

22:19.070 --> 22:20.940
so she didn't need to laugh!

22:22.450 --> 22:23.950
Wait,

22:24.420 --> 22:26.240
why are you laughing?

22:26.240 --> 22:27.660
Stop it!

22:31.080 --> 22:35.130
Why are you laughing at me now,
at the very last moment?!

22:35.130 --> 22:36.080
Stop laughing at me.

22:36.080 --> 22:38.300
Stop laughing.
Stop laughing!

22:38.960 --> 22:40.920
I won't be alone!

22:40.920 --> 22:48.350
Why, as my wives, are you laughing
at the thought of me being alone again?!

22:49.680 --> 22:51.390
This is absurd!

22:51.390 --> 23:02.240
I'm not wrong, I'm not wrong,
I'm not wrong, I'm not wrong!

23:03.490 --> 23:07.620
Normally, in a duel,
I would sheathe my sword

23:07.620 --> 23:09.870
as soon as my opponent
loses the will to fight.

23:10.410 --> 23:12.450
Y-You monster!

23:12.450 --> 23:13.750
That's right.

23:13.750 --> 23:16.290
I'm a monster who hunts monsters.

23:16.290 --> 23:18.250
It's high time you accepted your fate.

23:52.330 --> 23:54.910
You won't get away with this!
I won't allow it!

23:54.910 --> 23:58.000
I'll kill those three!

24:00.420 --> 24:03.050
Especially that woman!
She won't get away with this!

24:03.050 --> 24:07.050
That woman who was supposed
to be my 79th wife!

24:07.050 --> 24:11.180
Besides, that number
was originally meant for someone else–

24:15.350 --> 24:16.940
I remember now!

24:16.940 --> 24:17.980
It was her!

24:17.980 --> 24:22.940
The brat cherished by that impudent woman,
the former #79 and Petelgeuse!

24:25.900 --> 24:27.990
This is absurd!

24:27.990 --> 24:31.740
Are you telling me I'm going to die
and that girl's going to live happily

24:31.740 --> 24:33.910
knowing she avenged
her mother and Petelgeuse?!

24:34.740 --> 24:37.410
It makes me want to vomit!

24:39.580 --> 24:42.630
Emilia-tan, you don't look so relieved.

24:43.130 --> 24:44.750
About Regulus...

24:45.340 --> 24:48.470
I feel like it wasn't
the first time we've met.

24:48.850 --> 24:52.550
Really? When did you meet him, then?

24:52.550 --> 24:53.430
That's the thing.

24:54.310 --> 24:56.000
I can't remember.

25:00.690 --> 25:04.610
The thought of that woman
rejoicing over my death...

25:04.610 --> 25:06.280
Damn it!

25:06.280 --> 25:07.900
I'll never allow it!

25:07.900 --> 25:09.990
Never, never!

25:09.990 --> 25:16.200
Nevernevernevernevernevernever...

25:19.750 --> 25:24.000
Where did I bump into Regulus, again?

25:24.000 --> 25:27.010
REGULUS CORNEAS

27:03.180 --> 27:05.010
Hey, wake up.

27:06.020 --> 27:08.690
It's time to get up, sleepyhead.

27:20.490 --> 27:23.210
My Emilia-tan is really something else.

27:24.790 --> 27:28.790
I never would've thought
of freezing the wives

27:28.790 --> 27:30.710
and putting them in a death-like state.

27:31.550 --> 27:34.220
I've spent a long time frozen.

27:37.140 --> 27:39.300
I wonder how everyone's doing.

27:39.300 --> 27:41.640
That's what Reinhard's for.

27:42.170 --> 27:46.280
Besides, truth be told,
everyone's way stronger than me.
